# The repo-root .gitignore has a `core*` rule intended for crash-dump
# files (e.g. `core`, `core.12345`) that also unintentionally matches this
# workspace's `core/` crate directory (ppg3-core, WP1/WP2-Rust). Un-ignore
# it explicitly so `ppg3-core`'s sources are trackable.
!core/
!core/**
test/
